(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e幻想真境剧诗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e」，本玩法将提供丰富的原石奖励和不仅限在玩法内\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(30, 31, 32)\\\"\u003e的战斗增益效果\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。一起来了解基础规则、排期和可获得的奖励吧！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/05dda51488508c91c09612feb992061f_4302883245590941025.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1080\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/05dda51488508c91c09612feb992061f_4302883245590941025.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/6f9bfd7d5b2b07480d005ba0fba89a4e_3437888239654629097.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1080\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/6f9bfd7d5b2b07480d005ba0fba89a4e_3437888239654629097.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/04d94576be0a135334e34b5d3ad9a7ee_3326799110259295553.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1080\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/04d94576be0a135334e34b5d3ad9a7ee_3326799110259295553.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/f517aec786e1c4e28633eb81e7027c6c_4299132048936658181.gif\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"700\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 700px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/f517aec786e1c4e28633eb81e7027c6c_4299132048936658181.gif\\\" style=\\\"width: 700px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/002fabf43621a07cb23238bef749a3a4_7507565800951404435.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1080\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/16/50494840/002fabf43621a07cb23238bef749a3a4_7507565800951404435.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8980","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【幻想真境剧诗】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这是在幻想与真实的隙间上演着的无休止的冒险剧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e完成其中的挑战亦即演出，就能获得珍奇的宝藏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e每期幻想真境剧诗的挑战与限制，也会发生变化。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【规则：可出战与待命角色】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·可出战角色：在玩法挑战开始时就可用的一批角色，能直接加入队伍出战；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·待命角色：待命角色并非直接可用。旅行者需要通过完成战斗，或者触发抽取伙伴事件等方式，使这些待命角色转变为可出战角色。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【规则：角色的选取】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·开幕角色：当期指定的6名角色，这6名开幕角色将构成初始的可出战角色。幻想真境剧诗会提供这些角色的试用版。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·符合元素类型：符合当期元素限制的角色才能参与挑战。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·助演角色：除自己的角色外，好友选取提供的角色。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·特邀角色：当期指定的部分不受元素限制的可选角色。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【规则：角色的耐力】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e角色初始具有2点耐力值，在完成战斗事件后，将消耗1点耐力值。耐力值耗竭后，角色将无法参与战斗。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【规则：主题与重置】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e每月首日，幻想真境剧诗将自行重置，挑战与元素类型限制也会发生相应的变化。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【幻境祝福】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e解锁幻想真境剧诗后，将出现每期更新的幻境祝福，为当期开幕角色提供增益效果。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这些增益效果无论是在幻想真境剧诗的演出挑战中，还是剧场外的冒险中都会生效。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【奖励说明】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e通过一定幕数的挑战并完成结算后，可以获得奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e除此之外，还有机会获得玩具勋章，能够用于从小狼处交换特定角色的「表演诀窍」，丰富角色拍照时可用的姿势。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「表演诀窍」会随幻想真境剧诗更新增加。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【星章与勋章】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e达成一幕演出挑战的明星挑战并完成结算后，可获得相应一幕的星章。根据通过的演出幕数，还将获得不同华丽程度的勋章，这些勋章能在个人资料界面展示。\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8981","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1773649949","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"524","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"2716","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"8981","pos":"banner"},{"id":"8979","pos":"left"},{"id":"8980","pos":"right"},{"id":"8910","pos":"left"},{"id":"8911","pos":"left"},{"id":"8912","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"105","name":"活动","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"活动","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"display_type\",\"value\":\"default\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"跳转链接\",\"attribute_key\":\"jump_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon-pc\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url_pc\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon-pc-hover\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url_pc_hover\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"筛选器\",\"attribute_key\":\"filter\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"活动类型\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"纪行\\\",\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"游戏活动\\\",\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"活动祈愿\\\",\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"其他\\\",\\\"children\\\":[]}]},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"版本\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"常驻\\\",\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"1.0\\\",